  "comments": "<p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">José Maria da Silva Paranhos Júnior (1845 - 1912), Baron of Rio Branco, &nbsp;was a statesman, diplomat, and historian.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Varieties list (font variants aren't included, please see information bellow):</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">1. 1998, 2000, 2001: copper-nickel; \"T\" wholly inside stripes; 5 lines; no mintmark (KM#651);<br>2. 2002: stainless steel; \"T\" wholly inside stripes; 5 lines; no mintmark (KM#651a);<br>3. 2003, 2005, 2008: stainless steel; \"T\" partially inside stripes; 5 lines; no mintmark (KM#651a.1);<br>4. 2005-date: stainless steel; \"T\" partially inside stripes; 6 lines; no mintmark (KM#651a.1);<br>5. 2019: stainless steel; \"T\" partially inside stripes; 6 lines; \"A\" mintmark (KM#651a.1).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>5-6 lines variants:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6932a96521468.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6932a96521468.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">G in “PROGRESSO” (text on edge) varieties:</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5edd2d967c8a9.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5edd2d967c8a9.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">1. \"Arrow\" G with spud and bar, standard font for all years, including KM#651;<br>2. \"Large arrow\" G with larger spud and bar in 2018 and 2019 coins;<br>3. Regular G with bar in 2010-2013 coins;<br>4. Italic regular G in 2014 and 2015 coins;<br>5. Regular G with small bar in 2018 and 2019 coins.<br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">A new die was introduced in 2018 (the major diference can be observed in \"Rio Branco\" letter, which use bolder font than previous die):<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ede76e64a5fd.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ede76e64a5fd.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Variant on the edge of the 2020 coin (large letters and small letters):</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6561bfd537bc8.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6561bfd537bc8.jpg\"></a><br>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce218b51deb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce218b51deb.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2194490fb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2194490fb.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Official Sets - 2018 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2019 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"></a></p><p>Official card with complete set, including 1 real commemorative coin</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce21a745445.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce21a745445.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce21ac0ba70.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce21ac0ba70.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\">Official Sets - 2020 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:0px;\"><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6206caf9525a4.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6206caf9525a4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6206cb05ec58f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6206cb05ec58f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2021 - Mintage 5000 Sets</p>",
